OL,3,GNEWSAPreserved D-Day era floating
OL,4,Aroadway unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA floating World War Two roadway of the
OL,7,Ftype used during the D-Day landings has
OL,8,Fbeen unveiled following preservation
OL,9,Fworks.
OL,11,FAssociated British Ports (ABP) used
OL,12,Fcranes to lift the structure, known as
OL,13,Fa whale, from Town Quay in Southampton
OL,14,Flast year after it had spent decades
OL,15,Fpartially submerged.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
