OL,3,GNEWSAPreserved D-Day era floating
OL,4,Aroadway unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe unveiling of a plaque at its new
OL,7,Fhome outside Solent Gateway at
OL,8,FMarchwood, Hampshire, was carried out
OL,9,Fby the Lord-Lieutenant for the county,
OL,10,FNigel Atkinson, with the local MP,
OL,11,Flocal council leaders and veterans in
OL,12,Fattendance.
OL,14,FThe whale is one of only two known
OL,15,Fsurviving examples in England that are
OL,16,Fnot submerged.
